two-blocks.gltf: a stand (a base and a post) and a marker, written by hand
for MitCad's tests of the glTF import (core/gltf, mitcad#1826).

To the extent possible under law, the MitCad developers have waived all
copyright and related or neighboring rights to two-blocks.gltf
(CC0 1.0 Universal, https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
It is in the public domain: use it for anything, without asking.
